agent is the company's liability.

61
00:03:38,334 --> 00:03:40,854
Neither of these failures was
a model capability problem.

62
00:03:41,068 --> 00:03:42,434
Both were engineering problems.

63
00:03:43,164 --> 00:03:48,319
So here are-- The next story I wanna
talk about is not a failure story.

64
