That's a massive improvement, right?

73
00:04:26,758 --> 00:04:31,002
Well, less than 15 months later,
the same CEO says, and I quote,

74
00:04:31,767 --> 00:04:35,733
"We were so cost-focused, what you
end up having is lower quality."

75
